RMEnsure UtilityModule 3.10 Error This application is only suitable for use with RISC OS 3.10 or later versions
|
Set Printers$Dir  <Obey$Dir>
| Note that this version of !Printers is totally disc based
Set Printers$Path <Obey$Dir>.
Set File$Type_FC6 PrntDefn
|
| Ensure that there is enough memory for !Printers, some modules and some workspace
WimpSlot -min 192K -max 192K
| ArcLibre: 224K, not 128K: !RunImage is crunched but not squished (Acorn's
| squish is not public), so the program is 134K.
WimpSlot -min 224K -max 224K
|
| ArcLibre: no AUN remote printing (built without Sparrow); PDriver, in ROM in
| RISC OS 3.11, is loaded from this disc. Each class's support code loads its
| driver (PDriverDP or PDriverPS), PDumperSupport and the dumpers from
| Printers:Modules and PDumpers.
RMEnsure PDriver 3.25 RMLoad Printers:Modules.PDriver
RMEnsure PDriver 3.25 Error !Printers needs PDriver version 3.25 or later
|
IconSprites Printers:!Sprites
/<Printers$Dir>.SetPrint
WimpSlot -min 224K -max 224K
/<Printers$Dir>.!RunImage
